@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    Chrome-free layout for an unattended display.

    MainLayout exists for someone holding the device: a wordmark, navigation, an
    account name, a sign-out button. A smart mirror has none of those affordances
    and no one to use them - what shows through the glass should be the
    information and nothing else. It deliberately does not inherit MainLayout, so
    no navigation can leak onto the glass by accident later.
*@

<div class="mirror-shell">
    @Body
</div>
